{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "the-legend-of-vennessa",
  "name": "The Legend of Vennessa",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/The_Legend_of_Vennessa",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-12T09:01:05.289Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Vol. 1",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Friends of Mondstadt, let us revel! Drink to your hearts' content!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To freedom! To the Anemo Archon!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To Vennessa, the first Knight to grace this world!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sons and daughters of Mondstadt, may the gift from the Anemo Archon be engraved in your hearts!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And let it be known that this gift is not freedom, but just defiance!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It transpired in ages past."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Friends, do excuse me for improvising,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For it should be clear as day, that the glory and freedom of Mondstadt"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Were born when Barbatos struck the strings dolce."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Poems sing of heroic fame,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet to commemorate unnamed freedom should they aim."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Chained by royals, Mondstadt could barely suspire,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And festivities were but vanity games of the rich,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Beyond the grasp of the ordinary people."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A withering dungeon, Mondstadt was."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In slavery games the royal gaily relished,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oblivious to their place, the inmates were."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A fiery-headed dame confined to a cell,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "From the southern plains she did hail."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Born free but now bound by chains,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Though restrained by a tyrant her flesh remained."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Still her pious soul never ceased to pray,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For her people, for Mondstadt, for illusive freedom if she may."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "label": "Vol. 2",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Friends of Mondstadt, let us revel! Drink to your hearts' content!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The day came when Barbatos answered her devotion."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Anemo Archon sought her fiery hair and descended to her position."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Every being deserves a name,\" the spirit grinned."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"To weave your fair name into a song I yearn,\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"I seek nothing but your friendship in return.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The girl happily reciprocated, her fears swiftly dissipated."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And so, to the battlefield she marched to Barbatos' singing voice,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The demonic dragon fled from her might and the people did rejoice."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Corpulent aristocrats crawled under tables at such a valiant sight."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Mondstadt is freedom,\" the winds sang for their people in delight."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lonely forest breezes converged, jointly they overthrew the tyrant's tower from the sky."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Broken free from shackles at last, the young lioness stood firm in the winds with her head held high."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And so, the fiery-headed dame won herself prestigious fame."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Her heart swelled with appreciation to sing by the Anemo Archon's side."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But no words of gratitude should she utter, Barbatos replied:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"You first conducted what now transpires in your song.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"You have entrusted me with your friendship and your name.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"To praise your freedom, my songs came.\""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Friends, let us drink some more!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For thence flows the freedom of Mondstadt."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When days become nights and faces fill with despair,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Never forget the heroic tales of Vennessa, the dame with the flaming hair!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Never cease to pursue freedom, even when the land is bare!"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
